{"articleNo":"565291","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=565291&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 금오지 이용 활성화 및 시설 개선을 위한 설문조사 실시 안내","writer":"시설안전과","writeDate":"2026.06.08","hit":"3000","attachments":[{"name":"QR코드.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=565291&attachNo=164753"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">금오지 이용 활성화 및 시설 개선을 위한 설문조사 실시 안내</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">금오지 이용 활성화 및&nbsp; 시설 개선을 위해 학내 구성원들의 소중한 의견을 듣고자&nbsp;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>아래와 같이 설문조사를 실시합니다. 바쁘시더라도 많은 참여 부탁 드립니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1. 조사명 : 금오지 이용 활성화 및 시설 개선을 위한 설문조사</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2. 조사대상 : 학내 구성원 전체(교수, 교직원, 학생 등)</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>3. 조사기간 : 2026. 6. 2. ~ 21.(20일간)</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>4.조사방법 : 온라인 설문조사</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1m_xTacS9xalCTKzkz10FjREP0KfysndgpKas4Nm1QbM/edit)</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5. 참여혜택 : 설문 응답자 중 추첨을 통한 모바일 쿠폰 지급&nbsp; 18명</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(3만원권 3명, 2만원권 5명, 1만원권 10명)</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b><br></b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b><br></b></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
